amily: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 해기사(항해사, 기관사, 통신사, 운항사 등)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">라. 유치원·초등·중등·특수학교 교사 및 기타 이에 상응하는 학과 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">마. 기타 수의사, 사회복지사, 미용사 등 (전문)자격시험대상 학과 등</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013. 6. 10</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">학 생 처</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
